SDV simple:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:20ms+/-3ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, DL: 3ms+/-1ms)
    Actuator Signal Brake (periodic 30ms+/-1ms; offset:0ms+/-0ms, AD: 3ms+/-1ms)    
App :
    Component AEB_controler :
        Service S1:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera
            publish to VSS signal Brake
            triggered on Camera
            execution 3ms+/-0ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera -> S1 -> Brake